$ for e in "(" ")" "[" "a{1" "a{" "*" "*a" "+" "?" "a||b" "a|" "|a" "()" "\\" "callLLM(" "callLLM\\(" "a{2,1}" "[[:foo:]]" "systemPrompt:" "a)" "(a" ; do /usr/bin/grep -E -e "$e" </dev/null >/dev/null 2>/tmp/null_grep_$$; rc=$?; printf "bare %-14s rc=%s" "[$e]" "$rc"; /usr/bin/grep -E -e "($e)[[:space:]]*[\`\x27\"]" </dev/null >/dev/null 2>&1; printf "  composto rc=%s\n" "$?"; done; rm -f /tmp/null_grep_$$
bare [(]            rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [)]            rc=1  composto rc=1
bare [[]            rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [a{1]          rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [a{]           rc=1  composto rc=1
bare [*]            rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [*a]           rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [+]            rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [?]            rc=2  composto rc=1
bare [a||b]         rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [a|]           rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [|a]           rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [()]           rc=1  composto rc=1
bare [\]            rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [callLLM(]     rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [callLLM\(]    rc=1  composto rc=1
bare [a{2,1}]       rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [[[:foo:]]]    rc=2  composto rc=2
bare [systemPrompt:] rc=1  composto rc=1
bare [a)]           rc=1  composto rc=1
bare [(a]           rc=2  composto rc=2
[exit=0]
